cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this code, please cite the article below. To cite the code itself,
  use the Zenodo DOI of the release you used.
title: "scRNA-Annotation-Benchmarking-Runbook"
abstract: >-
  Code for a benchmark of 63 single-cell RNA-seq cell-type annotation tool
  configurations under a Taguchi L9(3^4) factorial simulation, a matched
  real-data panel, cross-platform transfer, database- and LLM-driven
  annotation, and fine-tuned foundation models. Contains the reference
  benchmarking harness, the code exactly as executed, and scripts that
  regenerate every published figure and statistic from the deposited data.
type: software
